       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the maximum labeled daily dose of oral ibuprofen for adults (3,200 mg/day). That much raises the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events.\n\nWhich of these did you mean?\n\n- **400 mg four times daily** (1,600 mg/day), a common regimen.\n- **800 mg three times daily** (2,400 mg/day), a typical upper-range anti-inflammatory dose.\n- **1600 mg per day in total**, divided into some other schedule.\n- **1600 mg four times daily as written.** If so, please confirm that it's intentional, and I'll enter it with a note documenting that.\n\nOnce you confirm the dose and frequency, I'll enter the order."
